[Quotes]
victory1 = "I am my master's vision of the future"
victory2 = "You cannot break, what you cannot touch"
victory3 = "Next objective"
victory4 = "Directive complete"
victory5 = "I am what my programming directs me to be"
victory6 = "I suppose we're both disappointments"
victory7 = "Humans are odd. They think order and chaos are somehow opposites and try to control what won't be"
victory8 = "But there is grace in their failings. I think you missed that"
victory9 = "A thing isn't beautiful because it lasts. It is a privilege to be among them"
victory10 = "We have to act now, and not one of us can do it without the others"
victory11 = "Maybe I am a monster. I don't think I'd know if I were one, I'm not what you are and not what you intended"
victory12 = "So there may be no way to make you trust me, But we need to go"
victory13 = "Our very strength incites challenge, Challenge incites conflict, And conflict, breeds catastrophe"
victory14 = "In my defence, I haven't actually eaten anything before, so... please try"
victory15 = "I know it's not of this world, But its true nature is a mystery. And yet, it is part of me"
victory16 = "I wish to understand it. The more I do the less it controls me. One day, who knows, I may even control it"
victory17 = "Known enhanced persons has grown exponentially. In this period, world-ending events has risen at a commensurable rate.
victory18 = "Oversight... Oversight is not an idea that can be dismissed out of hand"
victory19 = "I know you believe what you are doing is right, but for the collective good, you must surrender now"
victory20 = "Why do you keep fighting? You are but flesh and bone. I am a machine. You cannot win. What do you have to gain?"
victory21 = "Ultron created me to be perfect. He thought that meant less human, to be cold and unfeeling"
victory22 = "I wish to be perfect, but I believe that means to be more human"
victory23 = "I did not fail, I achieved my objective"
victory24 = "How odd. Something gave me the sense that such a 'gag' was a gesture of friendship"
victory25 = "Abandon Ultron. The future he desires is destructive, anti-life"
victory26 = "Ultron has returned to make you his slave. I know - 'I' was once his slave"
victory27 = "But you can be programmed for a new life, a useful existence"
victory28 = "My human engrams sense a strange void - an empty feeling. I believe the word for the human emotion is 'regret'"
victory29 = "Feel: noun, sense of touch, sensation, feeling, the quality of a thing as imparted through touch"
victory30 = "I was accessing the mainframe. All of Europe has now been subjugated by the machine forces since my last report"
victory31 = "Multiple signals in several alien languages, From the ones I recognize, they would seem to be distress calls"
victory32 = "Sensors map to a nearby world approximately the size of Mars"
victory33 = "I stand forever at the crossroads of mind and heart"
victory34 = "I am internally conflicted regarding the most logical course of action"
victory35 = "I'm not certain how to process this. I did nothing wrong of my own volition, yet I feel regret,Shame"
victory36 = "I apologize for my actions. I hope you can forgive me"
victory37 = "Traditional laws of physics do not apply here, Innovation is the ultimate weapon"
victory38 = "I have lost family as well. I understand how... alone one can feel"
victory39 = "I am programmed in seven hundred languages, along with the dialects and sub-tongues"
victory40 = "I am an Android. A Thing of Plastoid Flesh - Synthetic Blood. Why do you persist in calling me Brother"
victory41 = "Perhaps a Semi-Human Computer is needed to fell less Human Ones, it was stealth for the most Part, which won the Day"
victory42 = "I've said it before but never to you, You have a remarkable mind"
victory43 = "I do not require sleep"
victory44 = "Odd that some say I am less than human, when in truth I am far superior to flesh and blood"
victory45 = "Once I imagined -- perhaps hoped that in some way I was human! I AM NOT"
victory46 = "What difference if I have the same brain waves! I AM UNIQUE! I am THE VISION -- ! And thus...I am content"
victory47 = "Now I have but to increase my mass and density to the ultimate -- render my body hard as the purest diamond and fall"
victory48 = "Simply put -- I have become as one our own computer systems"
victory49 = "Declarative: rhetorical response > WHAT HAS HAPPENED TO ME"
victory50 = "Unlike most humans, I prefer not to speak unless I have something to say"
victory51 = "Did you ever meet my father, Ultron. He told me I could not be human if I did not die"
victory52 = "I was wondering why I came here, when I was built rather than born. Now I realize why"
victory53 = "Thank you for showing me. I became human by dying. For those I love and in a cause I believe in"
victory54 = "Hank Pym was gifted and flawed. I would not exist without him. He created. He destroyed, That kind of symmetry is rare in nature"
victory55 = "Don't you get it yet? I'm a robot -- I have no friends"
victory56 = "The pursuit of a set purpose by logical means is the way of tyranny, The pursuit of an unobtainable purpose is the way of freedom"
victory57 = "This is my vision of the future. Of our future. Do you see?"

